{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-68726","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130218","text":"FleetPrompt — User Stories"}]},{"id":"blk-68727","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130219","text":"Canonical user-story catalog. Each story is a Playwright-testable journey covering unit-tested code paths. Used for (a) e2e test generation in "},{"id":"spn-130220","marks":["code"],"text":"e2e-playwright/tests/user-stories/fleetprompt/"},{"id":"spn-130221","text":", and (b) as Claude Design input for UI generation."}]},{"id":"blk-68728","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130222","marks":["bold"],"text":"Scope:"},{"id":"spn-130223","text":" Agent marketplace with trust scoring, crystallization, install + review. "},{"id":"spn-130224","marks":["bold"],"text":"Unit-test surface covered:"},{"id":"spn-130225","text":" "},{"id":"spn-130226","marks":["code"],"text":"test/fleet_prompt/**"},{"id":"spn-130227","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-130228","marks":["bold"],"text":"114 tests defined"},{"id":"spn-130229","text":", of which "},{"id":"spn-130230","marks":["code"],"text":"mix test"},{"id":"spn-130231","text":" runs "},{"id":"spn-130232","marks":["bold"],"text":"112 green"},{"id":"spn-130233","text":" and excludes "},{"id":"spn-130234","marks":["bold"],"text":"2"},{"id":"spn-130235","text":" (tagged "},{"id":"spn-130236","marks":["code"],"text":"live_crystallization"},{"id":"spn-130237","text":"; they fail when included, because they need a live service)."}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68730","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130238","marks":["bold"],"text":"Corrected 2026-08-17."},{"id":"spn-130239","text":" This line said "},{"id":"spn-130240","marks":["bold"],"text":"157 tests"},{"id":"spn-130241","text":", and so did the landing page. Nothing in this repository has ever had 157 tests — re-derived by running the suite, not by counting files. "},{"id":"spn-130242","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-130243","text":" now executes "},{"id":"spn-130244","marks":["code"],"text":"mix test"},{"id":"spn-130245","text":" on every build of the landing page, parses what ExUnit prints, and refuses to emit the page if the number drifts from "},{"id":"spn-130246","marks":["code"],"text":"records/tests.json"},{"id":"spn-130247","text":". No gate would have caught the original error: nothing had ever run the suite and compared."}]}],"id":"blk-68729","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-68731","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130248","text":"Story 1 · Search and discover an agent"}]},{"id":"blk-68732","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68734","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130249","marks":["bold"],"text":"Persona:"},{"id":"spn-130250","text":" DevOps engineer looking for production-ready agents"}]}],"id":"blk-68733","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130251","marks":["bold"],"text":"Goal:"},{"id":"spn-130252","text":" Find a trusted customer-support agent that meets org security requirements"}]}],"id":"blk-68735","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68738","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130253","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prerequisite:"},{"id":"spn-130254","text":" Deployer logged in; at least 1 published agent in "},{"id":"spn-130255","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agents"}]}],"id":"blk-68737","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68740","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130256","marks":["bold"],"text":"Steps:"}]}],"id":"blk-68739","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-68741","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68743","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130257","text":"Click ⌘K search bar on marketplace homepage"}]}],"id":"blk-68742","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68745","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130258","text":"Type \"customer support\"; filter "},{"id":"spn-130259","marks":["code"],"text":"min_trust=70"}]}],"id":"blk-68744","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68747","kind":"paragraph","s